{
  "note": "Minimal golden suite v0 (2026-09-29), mock mode, no AWS. Extended to the full 45-case suite on the 11 Oct task (WEEK2_PLAN). Independent-mode plan_sale cases only: contract-mode is a stateful multi-call flow (switch mode, save terms), covered by tests/contract/test_sale_tools.py instead of this single-call runner. Multi-step cases (2026-09-29, health triage): `steps` run in order on one session; `save` keeps a result field for later steps (`$name`); `poll_until` repeats a read-only step until the agent's slow path finishes; `model_fixture` runs the case against a server whose model is a test fixture (tests/fakes.py), to prove the safety floor and fail-loud paths. `fresh_state` (2026-09-30, daily briefing) runs a case on a server of its own, so earlier cases' health checks cannot change its answer.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "farm-status-invocation-example",
      "description": "Doc PRD invocation example: shed two's mortality/feed alert.",
      "tool": "get_farm_status",
      "args": {
        "house": "shed two"
      },
      "checks": [
        {
          "field": "level",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": "alert"
        },
        {
          "field": "text_en",
          "op": "contains",
          "value": "26 birds died today"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "feed-plan-reorder",
      "description": "Shed two's low feed stock triggers a reorder suggestion.",
      "tool": "plan_feed",
      "args": {
        "house": "shed two"
      },
      "checks": [
        {
          "field": "plans.0.reorder_needed",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "field": "plans.0.stock_kg",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": 900
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sale-rising-mortality-sell-now",
      "description": "House 3: 3 days of rising mortality -> plan_sale says sell today (docs/DESIGN.md §12.4).",
      "tool": "plan_sale",
      "args": {
        "house": "shed 3"
      },
      "checks": [
        {
          "field": "plans.0.mortality_rising",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "field": "plans.0.best_day_index",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "field": "plans.0.break_even_day_index",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": 1
        },
        {
          "field": "text_en",
          "op": "contains",
          "value": "selling today is best"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sale-before-break-even",
